# ---- Build outputs ----
# NOTE: must stay anchored (/api-pack). A bare "api-pack" matches the
# directory cmd/api-pack/ and would silently ignore the main entrypoint.
/api-pack
/api-pack-new
__debug_bin*

# ---- Secrets / artifacts (never commit) ----
*.pem
*.json
*.env
*.bin
*.db
.gopath/
.gocache/
.claude/

# ---- Local scratch & ops logs ----
# Anchored on purpose: bare "trace" would also ignore the valid source
# directory cmd/trace/. Bare *.html is NOT used because
# internal/service/bilibili/{index,subtitle}.html are go:embed build inputs.
/trace
/vps_cpu_monitor.log
/vps_cpu_sampler.log
/vps_logs_combined.txt
/fetch_vps_logs.sh
/test_generator.html
# gzip test artifact regenerated by pkg/ginutil/handler/file_test.go
echo.go.gzip

# ---- Docs: keep NOTES.md, DOCS/ and pkg/ markdown ----
*.md
!NOTES.md
!DOCS/**/*.md
!pkg/**/*.md
